          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भटकना — bhaṭaknā — \"to wander; to lose one's way\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बच्चा भटककर नदी के किनारे पहुँचा। baccā bhaṭakkar nadī ke kināre pahũcā. The child wandered off and ended up on the riverbank."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (he …): वह रास्ता भटक गया, vah rāstā bhaṭak gayā."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "भटकना (bhaṭaknā) is set by CDIAL under Sanskrit bhraṣṭa, \"fallen, ruined\" (CDIAL 9655). It is wandering without knowing the way: रास्ता भटकना, to lose one's way."
            }
          ]
        },
